# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo. The env-file store does atomic,
# line-ending-preserving rewrites, and the Windows CI leg asserts on them, so a
# committed CRLF would cause spurious cross-platform drift.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
